        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keeya e Samuel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neye apa Samuel, neiturrurro Israel pooki aaishiraki ninye, nenukaa ninche ninye te nkaji enye te Rama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi o Abigail",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye Daudi nedoyio alo ong'ata e Paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa oltung'ani otii Maon, otii esiaai enye Karmel. Eikarsis apa ilo tung'ani oleng; eeta apa ninye nkerra nkalifuni uni o nkineji enkalifu nabo. Nebarnu apa ninye ilpapit loo nkerra enyena te Karmel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa enkarna e ilo tung'ani naa Nabal, ore enkarna e nkitok enye naa Abigail. Naa ng'en apa ina kitok neikishiaan kake kemoda apa olee naa torrono olkuaak; naa ole ntipat e Kaleb apa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nening Daudi ti ong'ata nchere ebarnita Nabal nkerra enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eirriwayie Daudi ilbarnot tomon; nejoki Daudi lelo barnot, “Elepa enchom Karmel, nipuopuo enetii Nabal, nirorokiki ninye te nkarna ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa nji enkuna te nirorokiki ninye: ‘Metaa enino eseriani, metaa eseriani ene nkaji ino, metaa eseriani ene lelo pooki liata iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aning nanu nchere iata iyie ilabarnok; etii oshi ilchekuti linono te nebo iyiook, neitu iyiook kintaas ninche entorrono, neitu ninche elau toki, ina kata pooki etii Karmel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkilikuana ilbarnot linono, amu eikiliki ninche. Metaa nchoo ilbarnot laainei etum omom too nkonyek inono; amu kipuonu iyiook te nkolong o sirua. Kitoomono iyie, nchoo pooki toki niaata isinkan linono o olayioni lino Daudi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee epuonu ilbarnot le Daudi, nejoki ninche nena pooki Nabal te nkarna e Daudi; netoni aanyisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Nabal isinkan le Daudi nejo, “Kaing'ae Daudi? Kaing'ae olayioni le Yese? Etii oshi taata kuna olong'i isinkan kumok oopuo aaing'uaa ilkituaak lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitayu nanu endaa ai o enkare ai o enkiring'o ai nateyieng'uo te nkaraki ilabarnok laainei, aisho iltung'ana ooing'uaa ewueji nemayiolo nanu ajo kaji eing'uaa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eibelekenyate lelo barnot le Daudi aapuo, neshuko neliki ninye ina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Daudi iltung'ana lenyena, “Teena pooki ng'ae olalem lenye!” Ore pooki ng'ae te ninche neen olalem lenye; neen sii ninye Daudi olalem lenye; nepuo iltung'ana oobaya iip ong'uan aasujaa Daudi, netoni iltung'ana iip are aarrip ilolan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaaka obo loo lbarnot Abigail, enkitok e Nabal, “Ng'ura, Eirriwua Daudi ilkiliku ooing'uaa ong'ata meetu aairoroki olkitok lang, kake etamoro ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eyia, eisupati apa lelo tung'ana te iyiook, neitu iyiook kitum entorroni, neitu iyiook kilau toki apa kitii ong'ota, te nkata naba anaa enikishomo te nebo ninche; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esuntai apa ninche te iyiook te nkewarie o te ndama, te ina kata pooki apa nikitii iyiook te nebo ninche king'orita nkerra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata tayiolo ena nidamu eniaas; amu eitobirakitia olkitok lang entorroni o enkaji enye pooki, naa kegogong ninye oleng meetae oltung'ani oidim airorie ninye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaae neisarrisar Abigail, neya imukateni iip are, o lbenia oare loo lonito le naisho oo sabibu o nkerra imiet naayieng'a, o ntemat imiet enkurma napejo o rridat iip loo sabibu, o mukateni iip are oo lng'abolo, neirragie ninche te nchumata oo sirkon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye lelo barnot lenye, “Enchom enturuko te dukuya nanu; ng'ura, kalotu nanu asuju intae.” Kake eitu ninye eliki olpayian lenye Nabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eloito ninye ekedito osikiria nedou alotu abori olmelil lo ldoinyo, ng'ura, nelotu Daudi, o ltung'ana lenyena aadou aanang'are ninye; nenang'are ninye ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netejo apa Daudi, “Esipa pesho apa nanu atorripo nena pooki naata ele tung'ani ti ong'ata neaku meetae entoki natalaki te nena pooki naara nkunenyena; naatushukoko ninye nanu entorroni te sidano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaasa Enkai ena te Daudi, neitulusoo sii, te natung'uayie nanu tadekenya obo lee le lelo pooki oora ilenyena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee edol Abigail Daudi, neisarrisar ninye, nedou to sikiria, nebatata ninye te dukuya Daudi te nkomom enye, neirrugo abaiki enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebatata ninye too nkejek enyena nejo, “Shumata nanu ake, olkitok lai, nchoo elotu entorroni; aatoomono nchoo esinka ino eiro too nkiyiaa inono, nining irorei le sinka ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mincho olkitok lai eshilaa ele tung'ani le ntorroni, Nabal; amu ore anaa enatiu enkarna enye, neijia etiu ninye, Nabal enkarna enye, netii emodai te nebo ninye; kake ore nanu esinka ino eitu adol lelo barnot lo lkitok lai, laa ninche iyie irriwua, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore naa taata, olkitok lai, anaa enaishu Olaitoriani, o anaa enaishu oltau lino, idolita ajo kimbooyie iyie Olaitoriani aitung'uaa enkibukoroto o sarge, o enkitalakunoto e lap te nkaina ino makewan, ore naa taata nchoo ilmang'ati linono o lelo ooing'oru aaitaas entorroni olkitok lai etiu anaa Nabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore taata ena kishoroto naa ninye eyaka esinka ino olkitok lai inchoo meishori lelo barnot oosuj olkitok lai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aatoomono tapalakaki engolong'akinoto e sinka ino; amu esipa keitaa Olaitoriani olkitok lai enkaji nauno, amu ilarrabali lo Laitoriani etii olkitok lai; nemetumi entorroni te iyie anaa ninchu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te nedumunye iltung'ana pee kisujaa iyie pee eing'oru enkishui ino, ore enkishui o lkitok lai naa keenari to rridata loo looishu te nking'urata o Laitoriani Enkai ino; ore enkishui oo lmang'ati linono nenang'aa ninye anaa osoit onang'ari te nkopito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eidip Olaitoriani aitaasa olkitok lai te risioroto e nena pooki sidain naairoro ninye ti alo iyie, nikitegelua ninye taa olkitok te shumata Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "metum olkitok lai enaitagor arashu enyamali o ltau, te nkibukoroto o sarge metii emporeet, arashu to lkitok lai eitalaku elap makewan. Ore ake pee kindip Olaitoriani aitaasa olkitok lai esidai, nidamu naa esinka ino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Daudi Abigail, “Meisisi Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel, laa ninye nikirriua iyie ena olong pee kinang'are nanu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metamayiani eng'eno ino, naa mikitamayiani iyie, aa iyie nikimbooyie nanu ena olong te nkibukoroto o sarge o te nkitalakunoto elap te nkaina ai makewan! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore te sipata anaa enaishu Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel, laa ninye laaibooyie nanu eitu aaitame iyie, te neme eisarisarua iyie nikilotu anang'are nanu, esipa ore tadekenya anaata eitu ninye elekakini Nabal hoo ninye olee obo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neng'amu Daudi too nkaik eina kitok ina nayaka ninye ninye; nejoki ninye, “Ilepa shomo te seriani enkaji ino; ing'ura, atoning'o nanu oltoilo lino, naishorua nanu ina omonunoto ino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Abigail enetii Nabal; naa, ng'ura eeta apa ninye osirua ti atua enkaji enye, anaa osirua lo laiguanani. Neng'ida apa oltau le Nabal ti atua ninye, amu etemere apa oleng; neaku eitu eliki ninye toki tukul o metaba anaa nekenyu awang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkakenya eishunye emerai te Nabal, neliki ninye enkitok enye kuna baa, neye oltau lenye ti atua ninye, netiu ninye anaa osoit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too nkolong'i naabaya tomon te siadi neosh Olaitoriani Nabal; neye ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ening Daudi nchere etua Nabal, nejo ninye, “Metamayiani Olaitoriani laa ninye oitalakua ina moroto apa natang'amua nanu te nkaina e Nabal, neibooyie ninye osinka lenye aitung'uaa entorroni; etushukoko Olaitoriani ina kiaas torrono enchumata endukuya enye makewan.” Neirriwaa Daudi iltung'ana pee esir Abigail aitaa ninye enkitok enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee epuonu isinkan le Daudi enetii Abigail te Karmel, nejoki ninche ninye, “Eirriua Daudi iyiook enitii pee kintaa iyie te ninye anaa enkitok enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye ninye neirrugo te nkomom enye o metabaiki enkop, nejo, “Ng'ura, ore esinka ino naa enkaisaayiani naituku nkejek oo sinkan lo lkitok lai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisarrisar Abigail, nedumunye neked osikiria, neisiaai ninye nkaisiaayiak enyena imiet; nesujaa ninye lelo kiliku le Daudi, neaku enkitok enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
